"837146485912209", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_837146489245542_2074176973414640307_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6mu_lUonXVkQ7kNvwEZFc-P&_nc_oc=AdrQiZYvs_S7jd0Vu0ZH0EoQdtihf9I2hJGjCWdLW6q_TfID2b_P5ZINYNkUVXLXLcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEuh5eD5hDXNMH7HjS52L3GR7HGu90a61mH2aDCSHT62w&oe=6A858365"}, {"file_name": "002.png", "id": "1928261387730595", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1928261391063928_7240850795307307332_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z9xFeC6AESYQ7kNvwGg5yIF&_nc_oc=AdosQhd-s_2sYAgCxiXEpJ9Bvnws3woTbUAPJkq8pID3tCvVtv9y_3GGhYQpTxmw1dE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEAtBxhJIZ36CLYt3lN0INwI688wGcsBbtx1Kec6euI8Q&oe=6A857BBF"}, {"file_name": "001.png", "id": "1535119994172532", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_1535119997505865_4009198314036636963_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-esVhfeRrk0Q7kNvwFKFA1h&_nc_oc=AdqcPLZjtFEHz6ebvfZN41eEkizzAAVbkNbm9UnwFSkW_LAy29FTHgmlWiJFmP1fMIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEbVNHPC6mpc9WdNTuY8NxUvMBfzKteOIoKQnSSxU2Cew&oe=6A85791F"}, {"file_name": "006.png", "id": "4349813078675519", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_4349813085342185_2481074008975818482_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lX2BC1Odrt4Q7kNvwGocJuN&_nc_oc=Adr2zpU_YCqJGUBAIH4dLxjUxIEdJ7Fc8LZDRYWAOs-oZ5MWZVJiOZXKGWy3RczgVz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGANhJLhJnhVL5eZxzTarwzgCQAy-HxUdwIITYOlleWag&oe=6A85910A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImage_Landscape_016.png", "id": "1374509167599243", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623370_1374509170932576_7907392765280961534_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69XmMTw01W8Q7kNvwEo7F7C&_nc_oc=AdrrmpfB6UEvltJAiI5BjdPl0ZiUe-6OPY_nkzYOUidtcV9lOPL8cpHeSwKRNviDVAU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG5U9d843fnvURZTvsXCwOgdJNavv6arP6vPHqOaS6gPw&oe=6A85AE4C"}, "display_name": "True Surf", "keywords": ["true", "surf", "surfing", "waves", "water"], "long_description": "**Welcome to True Surf, the ultimate surfing sim.**\nTrue Axis' real world physics engine, enables &#129327; **realistic wave graphics never experienced before.** \n\nDrop-in on a wild, water wonderland to feel the speed, power & flow from the real-world's gnarliest surf spots.\n\n{2572101493173541}\n\n# Your HQ\n&#129517; True Surf Tower\n\nTaking inspiration from the coral reefs of the Pacific, escape in your time traveling surf machine.\n\n{1288111046417067}\n\n&#129416; Wildlife\n\nSurf with dolphins, turtles, fish and more..\n\n&#127758; Real-World Map\n\nNavigate LIVE swells on the map, then pick your spot in the lineup.\n\n&#9889; Perfect Storm\n\nPlay god of thunder & boost LIVE swells.\n\n&#127940; Character & Quiver\n\nExperience apparel & boards from leading brands.\n\n{1137259105252895}\n\n&#127918; Settings & Stats\n\nFine-tune controls & analyze your performance.\n\n&#127909; Replay Editor\n\nWatch & edit your greatest waves with 8 x cams.\n\n&#127942; Leaderboards\n\nClimb the rankings | battle with mates.\n\n\n# Surf Spots\n\nGrind &#127919; missions & generate &#129305; shaka to unlock real-world surf spots.\n\n&#129470; Powered by real-time surf forecasting data from Surfline. \n\nIncludes:\n\n&#128305; Waikiki, &#127462;&#127482; Bells Beach, &#127467;&#127479; Hossegor, &#127482;&#127480; Lower Trestles, &#127487;&#127462; Jeffreys Bay, &#127475;&#127462; Skeleton Bay, &#127474;&#127485; Puerto Escondido, &#127467;&#127471; Cloudbreak, &#127477;&#127467; Teahupo'o, finishing up on Oahu, Hawaii at &#128165; Pipeline, the most iconic wave in the world!", "short_description": "Welcome to True Surf, the ultimate surfing sim. True Axis' real world physics engine enables realistic wave graphics never seen before. Drop-in on a wild, water wonderland to feel the speed, power & flow from the real-world's gnarliest surf spots!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://trueaxis.com/tsfvrpp.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "True Axis Pty Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://truesurf.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25176108902072470"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "919201781155925"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "761894030112566"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "756507604127660"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "756507604127660"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1782493200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "919201781155925"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27079234955093179", "version": "1.1.4"}, "id": "628282842437569", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5770505763059407", "is_concept":